Andy Johnson wrote:

> Does anyone else have a lettering scheme for their inventory items? I 
> always put certain items in certain letter slots, because my fingers 
> have gotten used to using those key combinations. I've assumed that 
> everyone else does the same thing, but now I'm actually wondering if 
> this is the case.

I tend to label weapons a, b and maybe c and then main armour continues 
alphabetically from there in the preferred order for getting dressed. Apart 
from that I don't use any consistent lettering across games although within 
a game I will try to keep the letters for important objects like BoH fairly 
static.

The main reason I don't go for a fixed scheme is that I'm too afraid of 
ending up with one of those YASD postings where someone assumed that they 
knew the letters of everything and didn't.

